  "description": "Midtail Cargo Designed To Answer The Call Of Adventure\n\nDesigned with epic adventurer John Freeman and his co-pilot Mira, the OmniTierra is a cargo-forward bikepacker's dream that rides just as confidently loaded as it does free—on remote trails and deep backcountry routes. The OmniTierra packs years of globe-spanning bikepacking experience into an uncompromising Titanium + Alloy build with a Pinion Gearbox and Gates Belt Drive.Designed for gear flexibility, terrain adaptability, and low maintenance riding. Non-electric, person-powered drivetrain.\nShipping December 2026\n(photo credit: Bikepacking.com / Miles Arbour)",
